{"id":"word:hebrew:H6680","type":"word","title":"צָוָה","subtitle":"H6680 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"(intensively) to constitute , enjoin","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to צָוָה (H6680) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 496 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"צָוָה (tsâvâh) means (intensively) to constitute , enjoin First listed occurrence: 1Chr 6 34."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"צָוָה","transliteration":"tsâvâh","pronunciation":"tsaw-vaw'","strong":"H6680","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6680","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["צִוָּ֥ה","צִוָּ֣ה","צִוָּ֧ה","וַ/יְצַ֣ו","צִוָּ֖ה"],"morphs":[["HVpp3ms",192],["HC/Vpw3ms",52],["HVpp1cs",34],["HVprmsc/Sp2ms",28],["HVpp1cs/Sp2ms",15],["HVprmsa",15],["HVpv2ms",12],["HVpp2ms",11],["HVpp3ms/Sp3ms",10],["HVpp1cs/Sp3mp",10]]},"definitions":{"short":"(intensively) to constitute , enjoin","usage":"appoint, (for-) bid, (give a) charge, (give a, give in, send with) command(-er, -ment), send a messenger, put, (set) in order.","full":"H6680. tsavah [ צָוָה ] 485 verb Pi`el lay charge (upon), give charge (to), charge, command, order (Ba ZMG xii (1887), 641 Gerber 124op. Arabic combine , II. enjoin , IV. charge ; injunction, command ; Thes compare Syriac , heap up (stones), , stone-heap , Arabic guide-stone , compare Schulth 57 ; Gerber makes Hebrew verbdenominative from מִצְוָה but verb is much earlier); &#8212; Perfect 3masculine singular צִוָּה Gen 6:22 +; suffix צִוַּנִי Deut 4:5 +; צִוְּךָ 4:23 +; צִוָּהוּ Gen 7:5 +, etc.; 1 singular צִוִּיתִי Exod 29:35 29 t., צִוֵּיתִי Lev 8:31 4 t., etc.; Imperfect 3masculine singular יְצַוֶּה Gen 18:19 8 t.; יְצַו Deut 28:8 ; וַיְצַו Gen 2:16 +; suffix וִיצַוְּךָ 1Chr 22:12 , etc.; 1 Chronicles 1s. וָאֲצִוֶּה Ezra 8:17 Qr (&gt; Kt ואוצאה ); 3 masculine plural וַיְצַזּוּ Gen 50:16 +, etc.; Infinitive construct צַֹוּת 2Sam 18:5 +, etc.; Imperative masculine singular צַוֵּה Josh 4:16 + 2t.; צַו Lev 6:2 9 t.; masculine plural צַוּוּ Josh 1:11 ; 4:3 ; Participle מְצַוֶּה Num 32:23 +; construct מְצַוֵּה Isa 55:4 , etc.; feminine מְצַוָּה Gen 27:8 ; &#8212; 1. a. lay charge upon , with עַל person, Gen 2:16 (J) 28:6 (P) 1Kin 2:43 ; 11:11 ; Amos 2:12 ; Jer 35:6 + 6t.; עַל of thing, מֵהַמְטִיר אֲצַוֶּה הֶעָבִים עַל Isa 5:6 , compare Job 36:32 , ׳צ עַלתָֿגָב 2Chr 7:13 . b. give charge to, command to with לְ person Exod 1:22 (E) 1Sam 20:29 ; 1Chr 22:17 ; Isa 13:3 ; Jer 32:23 ; Psa 105:8 צ ׳תּוֺרָה משֶׁה לָנוּ Deut 33:4 , compare Neh 9:14 ; לְבֵיתֶ֑ךָ צַו 2Kin 20:1 give charge to thy household (in preparation for death) = Isa 38:1 (compare Late Hebrew, B.Bath. 151b , צַוָּאָה 'verbal will' Id 147a ). c. give charge uno , with אֶל person Exod 16:34 (P), 1Kin 11:10 ; אֶלכֵּֿיתוֺ וַיְצַו 2Sam 17:23 (compare b. ). d. give charge over, appoint , with accusative of person + עַל of thing, Neh 7:2 ; 1Chr 22:12 , ׳צ עַל נָנִיד (לִהְיוֺת) appoint one (to be) ruler over 2Sam 6:21 ; 1Kin 1:35 ; with לנגיד 1Sam 13:14 ; 25:30 ; על שׁפטים 2Sam 7:11 = 1Chr 17:10 ; with infinitive (no על ), עמי לִרְעוֺת 2Sam 7:7 = 1Chr 17:6 ; לְעֵינֵיהֶם אֹתוֺ וְצִוִּיתָה Num 27:19 (P) and thou shalt install him in their sight , compare 27:23 (P). e. give one charge, command (often עַל concerning ), Gen 12:20 (J), Num 8:22 (P), 2Sam 14:8 ; 18:5 ; Jer 7:22 ; 39:11 ; Isa 45:12 (AV RV Che Ry Kau ; &gt; Ges Ew Di Du and others as d), 10:6 (al. against ), Nahum 1:14 (al. id. ); with לְ Num 9:8 ; 32:38 (P), Psa 91:11 ; Lam 1:17 ; Est 3:2 ; with אֶל Isa 23:11 ; Jer 47:7 . 2 charge, command: a. with accusative of person + thing, often, especially of the law: Deuteronomic phrases are מצוךָ אנכי אשׁר Exod 34:11 (J), Deut 4:40 ; 6:2 , 6 18 t. Deuteronomy, compare 15:15 ; אתכם מצוה אנכי אשׁר 4:2 (twice in verse) + 9 t. Deuteronomy; צ ׳אשׁר הַדֶּרֶךְ 13:6 ; 13:6 ; Exod 32:8 (E) Deut 5:30 ; 9:12 , 16 ; 11:28 ; 31:29 . b. with accusative of person + object clause, e.g., Infinitive Gen 50:2 +; ו consecutive Perfect 18:19 (J), Num 35:2 (P); ו consecutive Imperfect 2Sam 4:12 ; 1Kin 2:46 ; weak ו with Imperfect Exod 27:20 (P) Josh 4:16 ; Imperative 1:9 ; 1Sam 18:22 . c. accusative of person, accusative of thing omitted, Exod 18:23 (E) Gen 49:33 (P) +; object given after לֵאמֹר 26:11 ; 32:15 , 20 ; Lev 6:2 +; וַיּאֹמֶר etc., Gen 28:1 ; 49:29 +. d. accusative of thing, accusative of person omitted, ׳צ בריתוֺ לעולם Psa 111:9 ; צ ׳אֲשֶׁר ׳י הַדָּבָר וֶה , Exod 16:16 , 32 ; 35:4 ; Lev 8:5 ; 9:6 ; 17:2 ; Num 30:2 ; 36:6 (P); object clause, Lev 8:34 (P), 13:54 (P); Gen 42:25 (E), 1 Kings 5:20; Judg 4:6 . e. absolute Gen 50:16 (E), Lam 3:37 . 3 charge, command , accusative of person in phrase צ ׳כַּאֲשֶׁר Exod 23:15 (E) Gen 7:9 (P) +; צ אשׁר ׳ככל 7:5 (J) Exod 29:35 (P) +; צ ׳כאשׁר ׳י משֶׁה 12:28 , 50 ; 39:1 , 5 37 t. P; צ אשׁר ׳ככל ׳י משׁה 39:32 , 42 + 5t. P; צ אשׁר ׳לכל Josh 1:18 ; 22:2 ; Jer 35:8 ; accusative of person omitted צ ׳כאשׁר Exod 7:10 ; Num 32:25 (P) +; צ אשׁר ׳ככל 2Kin 11:9 2Chr 23:8 +; צ אשׁר ׳לכל Exod 36:1 (P). 4 charge , with command to others, commission , a. accusative of person + אֶל person (sometimes + accusative of thing) Exod 6:13 ; 25:22 ; Lev 27:34 (P) Deut 1:3 ; Jer 27:4 ; Est 4:10 ; accusative of person omitted Gen 50:16 (E) Est 3:12 ; 8:9 . b. בְּיַד of agent, + אֶל , Num 15:23 ; 36:13 (P); אֶל omitted Lev 8:36 (P), Ezra 9:11 ; Neh 8:14 . c. accusative of person + עַל for אֶל Ezra 8:17 ; 1Chr 22:13 ; Malachi 3:22; Est 4:5 . d. with accusative of thing, ׳וצ לְ כִּרְכָתִי Lev 25:21 (P) and I will command my blessing to you , with אִתְּךָ Deut 28:8 , compare Psa 133:3 ; ׳צ חסדוֺ 42:9 , בֹּקֶר Job 38:12 , חֶרֶב נָחָשׁ, Amos 9:3-4 ,. 5 command, appoint, ordain , of divine act: in creation Isa 45:12 ; Psa 33:9 ; 148:5 , providence 2Sam 17:4 ; Amos 6:11 ; 9:9 ; Job 37:12 ; Psa 78:23 ; Isa 34:16 , redemption Psa 7:7 ; 44:5 ; 68:29 ; 71:3 ; so of idol Isa 48:5 (|| עשׂה ). Pu`al Perfect 3masculine singular צֻוָּה Num 3:16 ; 36:2 ; 2 masculine singular צֻוֵּיתָה Gen 45:19 , etc.; Imperfect 3masculine singular יְצֻוֶּה Exod 34:34 ; &#8212; be commanded , i.e. receive command, subject person, Gen 45:19 (E), with בְּ by whom Num 36:2 (P); צ ׳אשׁר Exod 34:34 (P), צ ׳כִּיכֵֿן Lev 8:35 ; 10:13 (P), צ ׳כאשׁר Num 3:16 (P) Ezek 12:7 ; 24:18 ; 37:7 .","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 6 34","keyReferences":["1Chr 6 34","1Chr 14 16","1Chr 15 15","1Chr 16 15","1Chr 16 40","1Chr 17 6","1Chr 17 10","1Chr 22 6"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":496,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 6 34","book":"1Chr","chapter":6,"verse":34,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צִוָּ֔ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVpp3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 14 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":14,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צִוָּ֖/הוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVpp3ms/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 15 15","book":"1Chr","chapter":15,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צִוָּ֥ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVpp3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 16 15","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צִוָּ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVpp3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 16 40","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":40,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צִוָּ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVpp3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 17 6","book":"1Chr","chapter":17,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צִוִּ֛יתִי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVpp1cs"},{"reference":"1Chr 17 10","book":"1Chr","chapter":17,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צִוִּ֤יתִי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVpp1cs"},{"reference":"1Chr 22 6","book":"1Chr","chapter":22,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יְצַוֵּ֨/הוּ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vpw3ms/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 22 12","book":"1Chr","chapter":22,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וִֽ/יצַוְּ/ךָ֖","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vpi3ms/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"1Chr 22